ListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\" data-astro-cid-y4oyvcup> <a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"/about/\" data-astro-cid-y4oyvcup> <span itemprop=\"name\" data-astro-cid-y4oyvcup>About</span> </a> <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\">  </li> </ol> </div> </nav>  <main data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <!-- Hero --> <section class=\"about-hero section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--color-surface-dim)\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <p class=\"label-text\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Our Story</p> <h1 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>About Homeland Interiors</h1> </div> </section> <!-- Founder story --> <section class=\"founder-section section-padding\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"container founder-inner\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"founder-image-wrap\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <img src=\"/images/about/team.webp\" alt=\"Antony Rakshith, Founder of Homeland Interiors, at a project site in Bangalore\" width=\"600\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> </div> <div class=\"founder-story\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <p class=\"label-text\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>From the Founder</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Why I Started Homeland Interiors</h2> <div class=\"prose-custom\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>In 2018, I was working as a contractor for a large interior design firm in Bangalore. I watched clients receive beautiful 3D renders that bore no relation to what was actually installed in their homes. Subcontractors had no stake in the outcome. Change orders were charged at three times the original rates. Clients who had invested ₹15–20 lakhs were unhappy, and had no recourse.</p> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>I started Homeland Interiors in 2019 with one principle: everything we promise goes into the contract, and we deliver exactly that. Every carpenter, painter, and electrician on our projects is part of our in-house team or a long-term partner we supervise directly. We own the quality end to end.</p> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>We chose to work exclusively in South Bangalore — not because we couldn't operate elsewhere, but because knowing a neighbourhood deeply makes a difference. When I visit a flat in JP Nagar Phase 2, I already know to check for load-bearing wall positions, to ask about the monsoon seepage history, and to account for the society's 10am–5pm work restriction. That local knowledge is built over years, not something you can fake.</p> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Six years and 150+ projects later, that's still the approach. I still attend every new client site visit personally.</p> <p style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text)\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>— Antony Rakshith, Founder & Principal Designer</p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Stats --> <section class=\"stats-banner\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb> <div class=\"container stats-inner\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb> <div class=\"stat-item\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb> <span class=\"stat-value\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>150+</span> <span class=\"stat-label\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>Projects Completed</span> </div><div class=\"stat-item\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb> <span class=\"stat-value\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>150+</span> <span class=\"stat-label\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>Happy Clients</span> </div><div class=\"stat-item\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb> <span class=\"stat-value\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>4.5/5</span> <span class=\"stat-label\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>Average Rating</span> </div><div class=\"stat-item\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb> <span class=\"stat-value\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>6+</span> <span class=\"stat-label\" data-astro-cid-pzvlaunb>Years in Bangalore</span> </div> </div> </section>  <!-- Team --> <section class=\"team-section section-padding\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"team-header\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <p class=\"label-text\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>The Team</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>The People Behind Your Project</h2> <p class=\"team-subhead\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>A 20-person team covering design, site management, and client relations — everyone accountable, nobody anonymous.</p> </div> <div class=\"team-grid\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"team-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"team-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>A</div> <div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 class=\"team-name\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Antony Rakshith</h3> <p class=\"team-role\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Founder &amp; Principal Designer</p> <p class=\"team-detail\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>10+ years in residential interiors. Specialises in space planning and kitchen design for mid-size Bangalore apartments.</p> </div> </div><div class=\"team-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"team-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>M</div> <div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 class=\"team-name\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Meena Sharma</h3> <p class=\"team-role\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Senior Interior Designer</p> <p class=\"team-detail\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Trained in visual merchandising and residential design. Leads the Koramangala and HSR Layout project pipeline.</p> </div> </div><div class=\"team-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"team-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>R</div> <div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 class=\"team-name\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Ramesh Kumar</h3> <p class=\"team-role\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Site Supervisor</p> <p class=\"team-detail\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>15 years in construction and finishing. Manages on-site quality control, vendor coordination, and handover inspections.</p> </div> </div><div class=\"team-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"team-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>D</div> <div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 class=\"team-name\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Divya Nair</h3> <p class=\"team-role\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Client Relations Manager</p> <p class=\"team-detail\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Single point of contact for all client communication from site visit to handover. Manages the WhatsApp project update system.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Values --> <section class=\"values-section section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--color-surface-dim)\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"values-header\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <p class=\"label-text\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Our Commitments</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>How We Work</h2> </div> <div class=\"values-grid\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"value-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Honest Timelines</h3> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>We give you a room-by-room schedule before work begins and we stick to it. If something changes — weather, supply delay, site discovery — you hear from us within 24 hours, never the day before your moving date.</p> </div><div class=\"value-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>No-Surprise Quotes</h3> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Our quotes itemise every material, every fitting, every labour charge. The total you see on day one is the total you pay — unless you change the scope. We document every change order in writing.</p> </div><div class=\"value-card\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h3 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Local Knowledge</h3> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Six years of working exclusively in South Bangalore means we know which apartment societies have strict delivery windows, which areas need moisture-resistant specs, and which local suppliers deliver consistent quality.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Service area --> <section class=\"service-area-section section-padding\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <div class=\"service-area-inner\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r> <h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Our Service Area</h2> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>We operate within a roughly 30km radius of our studio on Kanakapura Main Road — covering all of South Bangalore. This isn't a limitation; it's a deliberate choice to ensure our project managers can reach any site within 45 minutes and our supply chain runs predictably.</p> <p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Our 12 primary service areas are: JP Nagar, Jayanagar, Banashankari, BTM Layout, Koramangala, HSR Layout, Electronic City, Bannerghatta Road, Kanakapura Road, Gottigere, Hulimavu, and Uttarahalli. We regularly take on projects in nearby areas — contact us to check coverage.</p> <a href=\"/areas/\" class=\"btn-outline\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>View All Service Areas</a> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Testimonials (different set from homepage) --> <section class=\"testimonials-section section-padding\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonials-header\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <p class=\"label-text\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Client Stories</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>More Client Stories</h2> </div> <div class=\"testimonials-grid\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <article class=\"testimonial-card\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonial-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>★★★★★</div> <blockquote class=\"testimonial-text\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>\"Homeland transformed our 2BHK in Phase 6 completely. The modular kitchen fits perfectly despite the awkward corner layout — something two other designers had said was impossible. Delivery was on time and the quote matched exactly.\"</blockquote> <footer class=\"testimonial-footer\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonial-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> P </div> <div data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <p class=\"testimonial-name\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Priya Nair</p> <p class=\"testimonial-meta\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Full 2BHK Interior · JP Nagar</p> </div> </footer> </article><article class=\"testimonial-card\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonial-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>★★★★★</div> <blockquote class=\"testimonial-text\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>\"Antony understood our brief from the very first meeting. We wanted a home office that didn&#39;t look like a home office in our living room. The result is better than what we imagined, and the folding partition system is genius.\"</blockquote> <footer class=\"testimonial-footer\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonial-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> S </div> <div data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <p class=\"testimonial-name\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Suresh &amp; Kavitha R.</p> <p class=\"testimonial-meta\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Living Room + Home Office · Koramangala</p> </div> </footer> </article><article class=\"testimonial-card\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonial-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>★★★★★</div> <blockquote class=\"testimonial-text\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>\"I&#39;ve seen plenty of interior designers overpromise. Homeland told us exactly what they could and couldn&#39;t do within our ₹8 lakh budget, gave us a phased plan, and executed Phase 1 without a single surprise bill.\"</blockquote> <footer class=\"testimonial-footer\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <div class=\"testimonial-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> A </div> <div data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7> <p class=\"testimonial-name\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Aditya Menon</p> <p class=\"testimonial-meta\" data-astro-cid-jlp24cq7>Modular Kitchen + Wardrobes · HSR Layout</p> </div> </footer> </article> </div> </div> </section>  <section class=\"cta-section cta-section--dark\" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii> <div class=\"container cta-inner\" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii> <div class=\"cta-text\" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii> <h2 class=\"cta-headline\" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii>Let&#39;s Build Somet